Likely next angles: **specific heat** of water (coastal climates, coolant use), **heat waves** and the **wet-bulb temperature** limit (35°C), **urban heat islands** and cool roofs, **heat pumps**, the **laws of thermodynamics** and engine efficiency, **conduction** in cooking vessels (copper bottom), and the **sea breeze / land breeze** as convection.
@end
